Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:23.48,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5A162F&\blur4\fad(200,200)}哲学越来越复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:26.74,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HC45C1B&\blur4\fad(200,200)}它有多种解读方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:30.18,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HF27BDF&&\blur4\fad(200,200)}只要离开这里就能勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:33.78,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFA838E&\blur4\fad(200,200)}向前迈进 我相信这样的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.09,0:01:37.18,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDF7D3D&\blur4\fad(200,200)}必须改变心态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:40.71,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}就是今天 说到做到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:45.08,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEF8AE4&\blur4\fad(200,200)}为了自由 迎风而立
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:52.16,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}数123 向天空高喊
